  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 — API cleanup and discovery rework. Breaking changes:\n - Removed synchronous IAggregatedDocumentStore.Get/Exists (use GetAsync).\n - Removed Swagger:OnlyPublishedPaths metadata key and SwaggerEndpoint.OnlyPublishedPaths (use Swagger:PathFilter).\n - SwaggerAggregationOptions properties switched from init to set.\n - Default ISwaggerEndpointProvider is now HybridSwaggerEndpointProvider (config + YARP runtime).\n - SwaggerAggregationBuilder.Configure / AddSwaggerAggregation(Action<SwaggerAggregationOptions>) now use PostConfigure so user overrides run after BindConfiguration.\nAdded: SwaggerDocumentCoordinator (dedup load/merge), HybridSwaggerEndpointProvider, SwaggerEndpointDiscoveryHelper, SwaggerDocumentUnavailableException, Yuzhu.Yarp.Swagger.Tests project.\nSee CHANGELOG.md for the full migration guide.",
